					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_3beta_f980370_1347884164490_467706_2855' body='AMU exists in the resource A (used project) pointing to resource B (another used project in main project) but there is no direct or indirect path of normal/user-defined project usages from resource A to resource B. But there is a direct or indirect path of normal/user-defined project usages from main project to resource B.'>
