						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_18_1beta_8c6027f_1400669353202_686478_3929' body='This rule covers two symmetrical activity parameter node constraints:&#10;&#10;1. An ActivityParameterNode with no outgoing ActivityEdges and one or more incoming ActivityEdges must have a parameter with direction out, inout, or return.&#10;&#10;2. 2. An ActivityParameterNode with no incoming ActivityEdges and one or more outgoing ActivityEdges must have a parameter with direction in or inout.'>
